<section class="reel-page">
  <div class="reel-head">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">08 // MOTION REEL // 900 FRAMES // 0 KEYFRAMES</p>
      <h1>NO KEYFRAMES.<br><span>JUST MATH.</span></h1>
      <p class="lead">Programmatic motion study: shape, easing, sine field, sphere and a four-panel procedural breakdown. Every frame is code.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="reel-meta">
      <span>60 FPS</span>
      <span>1920 × 1080</span>
      <span>15.0 S</span>
      <span>900 FRAMES</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="reel-stage" id="reel-stage">
    <canvas id="reel-canvas" width="1920" height="1080"></canvas>
    <div class="reel-hud" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="reel-corner reel-corner-tl">+</span>
      <span class="reel-corner reel-corner-tr">+</span>
      <span class="reel-corner reel-corner-bl">+</span>
      <span class="reel-corner reel-corner-br">+</span>
      <span class="reel-hud-tl">RUSTWEB // MOTION REEL</span>
      <span class="reel-hud-tr">60 FPS / 1920×1080</span>
      <span class="reel-hud-bl">FRAME <b id="reel-frame-hud">000</b> / 900</span>
      <span class="reel-hud-br">NO KEYFRAMES</span>
      <span class="reel-scene-hud" id="reel-scene-hud">00 // INTRO</span>
      <span class="reel-rec"><i></i> REC</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="reel-controls">
    <button id="reel-play" class="button" type="button">PAUSE</button>
    <button id="reel-restart" class="badge" type="button">RESTART</button>
    <button id="reel-full" class="badge" type="button">FULLSCREEN</button>
    <input id="reel-scrub" type="range" min="0" max="900" value="0" step="1" aria-label="Klatka motion reel">
    <span class="reel-counter"><b id="reel-frame">000</b> / 900</span>
    <span class="reel-timecode" id="reel-timecode">00:00:00:00</span>
  </div>

  <div class="reel-timeline" id="reel-timeline">
    <span data-scene="0" class="is-active">00 INTRO</span>
    <span data-scene="1">01 TITLE</span>
    <span data-scene="2">02 KINETIC</span>
    <span data-scene="4">03 EASING</span>
    <span data-scene="7">04 PROCEDURAL</span>
    <span data-scene="10">05 CORE</span>
    <span data-scene="12">06 OUTRO</span>
    <i id="reel-playhead"></i>
  </div>

  <div class="reel-bottom">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">THE LOOP</p>
      <h2>SHAPE → EASING → FIELD → CORE.</h2>
      <p>Scena jest rysowana w canvasie 2D. Punkt na wykresie to funkcja czasu, nie keyframe. Sine field morphuje w sferę, a cztery panele pokazują rotate, squash, offset i wave.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="reel-links">
      <a class="button" href="/baner">ZOBACZ BANER</a>
      <a class="button ghost" href="/market">ZOBACZ MARKET</a>
      <a class="button ghost" href="/deploy">POSTAW U SIEBIE</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
